5,1,1,talk,George,,We need to stop guessing. The silence lately is worse than the noise.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,Agreed. The current method consumes more time than the driving itself.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I worry about the car’s condition when I arrive. It feels neglected.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,We need data. Guessing leads to resentment. Let’s look at the facts.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,I just want to know the real cost. It feels unfair to guess.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,George,,I want to understand why we drift apart. Let’s check our past attempts.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I will examine the hours recorded. I need to see the administrative burden.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,I need to know the car’s state at handover. That is my main fear.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I will look at the fuel receipts. I need to see the actual spend.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minato,,I will check the tax and insurance papers. I need the fixed costs.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,George,,"@Misaki, do you think the numbers will fix the mood?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@George, numbers clarify. They do not fix mood, but they stop arguments.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, if the car is dirty, the numbers don't matter to me.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@George, clarity reduces stress. I believe in the process.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, I understand. But we need the baseline first.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,George,,Let’s proceed. I will look into what other households did.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I will also check the mechanic's remarks. Maintenance affects usage.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I will check the state of the car at handover.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
