35,2,1,talk,George,,I found that asking favours sours groups. We must avoid that trap.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,My diary shows usage is wildly uneven. Weekends are triple the weekday load.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Victoria,,I found the car is often dirty or low on fuel. It feels disrespectful.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,The fuel receipts show a huge imbalance. Two people drive far more than the rest.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minato,,"The fixed costs are high, but the fuel split is very uneven. It hurts to see.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,George,,"@Misaki, that imbalance explains the tension. We need a fairer system.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@George, yes. The coordination cost is high because usage is so variable.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, the variable usage makes the car unreliable for my specific needs.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@George, I agree. A flat split subsidises the heavy users. That is unfair.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Misaki, I feel the same. The heavy users should pay more for the fuel.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,George,,We need a model that doesn't require constant asking. That is the key.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,I need a system that minimizes the time spent calculating who owes what.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Victoria,,I need a guarantee. I need to know the car is ready for me.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,I need a system where cost follows usage. No hidden subsidies.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minato,,I need a system that feels honest. I don't want to feel like a burden.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,George,,Let’s look at the options. I want to protect our friendship.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I will support the option that reduces administrative friction the most.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Victoria,,I will support the option that guarantees my access and the car's state.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Misaki,,I will support the option that ties cost directly to individual usage.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minato,,I will support the option that feels most fair and transparent to everyone.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
