60,3,1,talk,George,,Option A seems best. It removes the need to ask favours.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"Option A is efficient. The calendar handles the scheduling, and the distance handles the cost.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"Option B is risky. If I am allotted a day, I still don't know the car's state.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Misaki,,Option A is the only one that ties cost to usage. It is the fairest.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Minato,,Option A feels honest. I like that we pay for what we use.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,George,,"@Victoria, Option A requires us to log the car's state. Can we trust that?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@George, we can add a simple checklist to the booking. It takes seconds.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, a checklist is a start. But I need a guarantee of fuel.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Victoria, the cost follows the fuel used. If you use it, you pay for it.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Minato,,"@Misaki, that makes sense. It feels very fair to me.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,George,,I am concerned about the friction of logging. But it is better than asking.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Toshio,,The friction is minimal. It is far less than the current arguments.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Victoria,,"I am still hesitant. But if the state is logged, I can plan better.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I am confident in Option A. It solves the subsidy problem.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Minato,,I feel safe with Option A. It is transparent and clear.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,George,,I will vote for A. It protects our social dynamic.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Toshio,,I will vote for A. It minimizes the administrative burden.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Victoria,,I will vote for A. It offers the most structure for my needs.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
